slot. for Android: INTRO, the start-up screens in ORIGINAL or EXPAND.
A new option, pokedaisy_intro (original by default). ORIGINAL keeps
patch 06: the boot, the intro, the title and the first menus at the
game's own shape until the game is seen. EXPAND keeps the wide canvas
from the start, with plain sides (the frame's colour at 60 %, black
when it has none) and no blend toward the game's edges, on Game Boy,
Game Boy Color and GBA alike. slot. sets it per game from its Screen
page (Siham 2026-11-27).

diff --git a/app/src/main/cpp/pk_wide.c b/app/src/main/cpp/pk_wide.c
